title: "otwin-spec: a conformance specification for physics-informed digital twins"
abstract: "The normative Otwin specification: the Twin Manifest JSON schema, golden fixtures whose answers are known in closed form, and a language-agnostic conformance runner that judges implementations in Python, Julia and MATLAB."
